RUNNER_ROOT_CAUSE=main() validates argv then calls preflight_no_build(), but preflight relies on static
     reachability AND the caller still controls the selection set. Both premises must be removed.

GATE_CLOSURE_DECISION=
  no-build runner: architectural change, not more detection.
    (a) runner accepts NO caller-supplied test selection (path/nodeid/dir/-k/--ignore); fixed internal corpus only
    (b) runtime tripwire: runner sets an env var; build_all() raises immediately when it is set
    static transitive scan demoted to advisory, no longer the sole guarantee
  residue auditor: explicit threat-model boundary.
    covers direct and compile-time-resolvable forms; unresolved dynamic values fail closed at critical sinks;
    deliberate obfuscation by a local author is OUT OF SCOPE (a malicious local author can edit the gate itself,
    and the Credential Guard threat model never included one)

