## Task C decision: 方案甲 (versioned manifest filename)

Chose: dist/artifact-manifest-0.4.0.json alongside frozen dist/artifact-manifest.json (0.3.1).

Why not 方案乙 (dist/0.4.0/ subdirectory):
  * verify_artifact_manifest() hardcodes dist = base/"dist" and resolves
    artifacts as dist/filename (basename only). Subdir would require changing
    that path contract and STANDARD_ARTIFACT_FILENAMES resolution.
  * Acceptance item 7 expects dist/ to have exactly 8 flat members after land.
  * Historical _DIST_ARTIFACTS and topology enumerate flat dist/ paths.

Why not overwrite artifact-manifest.json:
  * 禁 1 — 0.3.1 historical asset, unrecoverable (not a git repo).

Why not dual-load fallback (unversioned OR versioned):
  * Would create two possible truth sources for "current" manifest.

Implementation:
  * ARTIFACT_MANIFEST_NAME / ARTIFACT_MANIFEST_FILENAME = artifact-manifest-0.4.0.json
  * write_artifact_manifest / load_artifact_manifest / verify_artifact_manifest
    all use the versioned name; fixtures updated.
  * Historical dist/artifact-manifest.json untouched.

